  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4727,
      "text": "Likewise, no messenger came to those before them without being told: “A magician, or a madman!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4728,
      "text": "Did they suggest this to one another[17]? Rather they are transgressing people.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 53,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4729,
      "text": "So turn away from them [O Prophet], for you are not to blame[18].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 54,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4730,
      "text": "But keep reminding them, for reminder benefits the believers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 55,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4731,
      "text": "I have not created the jinn and mankind except to worship Me.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 56,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4732,
      "text": "I seek no provision from them, nor do I want them to feed Me.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 57,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4733,
      "text": "Indeed, it is Allah Who is the All-Provider[19], Lord of Power, the Mighty.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 58,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4734,
      "text": "Indeed, those who do wrong will have a share [of punishment] like that of their predecessors, so let them not ask Me to hasten it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 59,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4735,
      "text": "So woe to those who disbelieve from [the punishment of] the Day which they are promised.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 60,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4736,
      "text": "By the mount of Tūr[1],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4737,
      "text": "and by the Book inscribed[2]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
