      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4741,
      "text": "and by the sea set on fire[5].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4742,
      "text": "The punishment of your Lord will surely come to pass;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4743,
      "text": "there is none who can avert it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4744,
      "text": "On the Day when the heaven will convulse violently[6],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4745,
      "text": "and the mountains will move a horrible movement[7].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4746,
      "text": "Then woe to the deniers on that Day,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4747,
      "text": "those who amuse themselves in falsehood.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4748,
      "text": "On the Day when they will be shoved into the Fire forcefully,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4749,
      "text": "[They will be told,] “This is the Fire which you used to deny.",
